title: "Active Inference Ontology"
abstract: >-
  A controlled vocabulary of Active Inference and Free Energy Principle
  concepts, published through a versioned structured source, deterministic
  JSON and CSV exports, an explicit stable-identity model, typed relation
  records, release-integrity manifests, and a generated manuscript.
